[EXAMPLES]
Convert a CSV file to rec format:

  csv2rec data.csv > data.rec

Convert CSV with a specific record type name:

  csv2rec -t Contacts data.csv > contacts.rec

[SEE ALSO]
.BR rec2csv (1),
.BR json2rec (1),
.BR xml2rec (1),
.BR rec2json (1),
